      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1904-04-16_WidnesExaminer_art0134" n="art0134">
        <head>FIRST ROUND.</head>
        <p>FIRST ROUND.</p>
        <p>I J. Hynd 2 H. Morrall 3 F. Dnnne 2 T. Goldsboro 2 J. Alexander 1 0 A. Hynd 0 *T. Dean 0 3 W. Blakeley 3 J. A. Minn 2 T. Worthington 2 R. T. Ward 3 W. H Waller 1 R. Parry 5 W. T. Jones 0 *Retired without playing. SECOND ROUND.</p>
