        <p>INSTANT RELIEF, RAPID CURE OF GOUT AND RHEUMATISM. BY EADES. PILLS. A RECORD CURE ! 32, Archer-street, Bayswater, London, W. Dear Sir,—Sunday night my big toe pained me, on Monday it was much worse, and in the evening I could scarcely walk. At 6 p.m. I sent for a bottle of your Gout Pills, and took two at once. At 9.30 I was much relieved, and could eat my supper. I took another before going to bed, and although so hot I got a fair night's rest. I have taken two more pills to-day, and now, at 6.30, lam alright again. This is a record care. Yours truly, PHILIP BRANS. EADE'g GOUT PILLS Are perfectly safe in their action, eliminate all inimious matter, and axe highly restorative. Sold everywhere in bottles, ls. lid.and 2s. 9d. or sent post free for stamps or P.O. by the proprietor, GEORGE EADE, 232, Goswell road, London. EADE'S GOUT &amp; R</p>
